# Deny-by-default build context.
#
# The previous version mirrored a handful of .gitignore entries by hand and
# drifted: `.env` was excluded but `.env.local` and `.env.dev` were not, so a
# plain `docker compose up --build` baked deployment credentials into image
# layers. Git's ignore rules are not a build-context boundary, and keeping two
# hand-maintained lists in sync had already failed once.
#
# Everything is excluded, then re-included by name below. A new file is out of
# the image until someone adds it here on purpose. If a build or an in-container
# `npm test` fails on a missing path, add that path — do not relax the `*`.

*

# Sources compiled by `npm run build` and loaded at runtime.
!src/
!runtime/
!sdk/
!cli/

# Test, conformance, tooling and demo surfaces. CI runs `npm test` and
# `npm run smoke:revocations` inside this image, so they must be present.
!tests/
!tools/
!scripts/
!schemas/
!spec/
!config/
!examples/

# Two docs are test fixtures: 0.4-defaults-inert asserts the runtime gate
# defaults against the gate table, and error-code-stability asserts every major
# error code is documented. The rest of docs/ stays out — it carries the ignored
# white-paper PDF and zip, plus history/ images whose redistribution rights are
# unresolved.
!docs/0.4-gates.md
!docs/intentos-federation.md

# Build and test configuration.
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!tsconfig.jest.json
!jest.config.cjs

# License and notice material travels with the distributed artifact.
!LICENSE
!LICENSES/
!LICENSING.md
!NOTICE
!TRADEMARKS.md

# Re-exclusions: these live inside allowed directories, so `*` no longer covers
# them and they need to be named again.
runtime/*.sqlite
runtime/*.db
runtime/federation-keys.json
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules
